{
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "speaker": "hayes",
   "text": "Alright. The twenty twenty-four envelope. Macklin Celebrini, goals... rookie year in San Jose.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 6.48
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "speaker": "odog",
   "text": "Eighteen years old, on a team that was BRUTAL. That's a tough number to put your name on.",
   "start": 6.48,
   "end": 12.56
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "speaker": "hayes",
   "text": "Justin came in at... nine.",
   "start": 12.56,
   "end": 15.6,
   "hl": [
    "justin"
   ]
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "speaker": "odog",
   "text": "NINE? He's got the first overall pick on the fourth line. I really don't know what he watched.",
   "start": 15.6,
   "end": 22.48
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "speaker": "hayes",
   "text": "Nick had him at fifteen. Jay... twenty-two.",
   "start": 22.48,
   "end": 26.799,
   "hl": [
    "nick",
    "jay"
   ]
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "speaker": "hayes",
   "text": "And Chris. Twenty-five.",
   "start": 26.799,
   "end": 29.12,
   "hl": [
    "chris"
   ]
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "speaker": "odog",
   "text": "Twenty-five, for a rookie on THAT roster. That's a man who actually watched the World Juniors.",
   "start": 29.12,
   "end": 35.76
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "speaker": "hayes",
   "text": "The actual... Macklin Celebrini... twenty-five goals.",
   "start": 35.76,
   "end": 41.36,
   "reveal": true
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "speaker": "odog",
   "text": "ON the number! Not close. Not in the neighbourhood. RIGHT on it. That's a scouting report, boys!",
   "start": 41.36,
   "end": 48.72
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "speaker": "hayes",
   "text": "Chris takes the W. Justin... sixteen off... wears the L. Back after this.",
   "start": 48.72,
   "end": 55.2,
   "final": true
  }
 ],
